# Regression: a file ending with --- %name and no body silently drops the empty
# trailing document.  The file's output is the last document that *has* expressions
# (doc 1 here).  %name is never bound because the empty document is never created.
[x: 1  y: 2]
--- %unused
=== out
Dict({"x": Int(1), "y": Int(2)})
